ext Fest – October 2026, and we'd love to hear what you think about the latest changes!🚐 Van ImprovementsPlacing items in the van's cargo area now requires just one click.You can now interact with the van's doors while holding an item.⚙️ UI & Qua","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:07:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691585","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4754910-1846651706677586","game_id":"steam-4754910","kind":"update","title":"DEMO HOTFIX 15.10.2026","summary":"Hi!We're sending over a hotfix for our demo.We fixed an issue where text wasn't displaying in certain languages due to a font problem.Thanks for reporting the issue and for your feedback!DreamWay Games Team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T12:49:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677586","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4754910-1846018067943698","game_id":"steam-4754910","kind":"announcement","title":"Steal & Sell Simulator - DEMO is RELEASED!","summary":"Hi! We're launching our demo! You can play it NOW!We've improved a few things that you reported during the playtests. Moreover, our demo will be part of the Steam Next Fest: October 2026! So, play and let us know what you think!We're looking forward to your feedback!DreamWay Games Team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T11:07:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943698","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4754910-1846018067940640","game_id":"steam-4754910","kind":"announcement","title":"Steal & Sell Simulator - demo PLAYTESTS are CLOSED!","summary":"Hi! As we announced, we’re closing our short playtests.We’d like to thank everyone who played and left us their valuable feedback — we’re analyzing it right now. Many changes will be implemented (and some already are!).Our demo release is coming very soon (really soon!), so stay tuned ːsteamhappyːDreamWay Games Team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:12:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940640","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4754910-1846018067929282","game_id":"steam-4754910","kind":"announcement","title":"Steal & Sell Simulator - demo PLAYTESTS are OPEN NOW!","summary":"Hi! Playtests of the demo of Steal & Sell Simulator are... OPEN!Everyone is getting access - so if you didn't sign up before, you can still join 🙂 The playtests will last until Monday. So it's worth hurrying 🙂 You are allowed to stream! Why so short? We want to collect your feedback as quickly as possible and know what to improve and which direction to take in development. DreamWay Games Team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T11:17:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929282","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4754910-1844751498218401","game_id":"steam-4754910","kind":"announcement","title":"SIGN UP for the demo PLAYTESTS!","summary":"Hi! We have some great news for you! You can sign up for the playtests of the demo of Steal & Sell Simulator!How can you get access to the playtests? It's very easy. You just need to go to our store page and click on the 'Request access' button. It couldn't be easier! When will you be notified about the start of the playtests?Once registration closes, you will receive an email invitation to the playtests. Check it regularly! We can say that you will be able to play... really soon!DreamWay Games ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T13:19:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218401","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4754910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4754910":"2026-10-26T14:06:46Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4754910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:45Z"},"5124350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:46Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4754910","app_id":4754910,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:55Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"f44712d7d67f5a66b6b292f86904aaefb1783f7bd7815643f5649cda971afb03","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"밤에는 귀중품을 훔치고, 낮에는 자신의 가게에서 판매하세요. 훔친 물건으로 수익을 올리고, 가게를 업그레이드하며 범죄 사업을 키워 나가세요. 더 크고 위험한 절도에 도전해 진열대를 채우고 수익을 늘리세요. 하지만 조심하세요! 경찰이 점점 가까워지고 있습니다.","publishers":[{"name":"PlayWay S.A.","creator_clan_account_id":33701576}],"developers":[{"name":"DreamWay Games","creator_clan_account_id":43827684}]},"release":{"steam_rel